-- Item.db2 rows the Forever client 70685 lacks: it has the ItemSparse row of these items but not the Item one (class, subclass,
-- inventory type, icon), which the live Forever server pushes as a hotfix. Without it ObjectMgr::LoadItemTemplates builds no
-- template, quests drop the reward ("item with entry ... does not exist") and the client cannot draw it. The Troll Cave (182)
-- offered four Anvilmar weapons the window never showed, and The Stolen Journal (218) two (Olo / DT, 30 Oct).
-- 12754 rows: every item of wago.tools Item (build 1.60.1.70532) that has an ItemSparse row (client data or hotfix) and no Item
-- row (client data or hotfix); 1372 of them are quest rewards. No hotfix_data rows: a client missing an Item row asks for it
-- (CMSG_DB_QUERY_BULK) and the server answers from its store, which loads this table.
DELETE FROM `item` WHERE `VerifiedBuild` = 70532;
